Estimation of heavy metals
Calibration was done with multi-element calibration standard
for the heavy metals viz. aluminium, cadmium, chromium,
and lead in aqueous medium linear range of 0 ppb to 1 ppm.
Calibrations of Arsenic and Mercury elements were done
using the VGA (Vapour Generation Accessory) unit of ICPOES in aqueous medium linear range of 0 ppb to 100 ppb.
